# Redirects from the old Quarto-built query.farm (github.com/Query-farm/query-farm)
# to their equivalents on this Astro site. Source paths are taken verbatim from
# the old site's sitemap.xml — the URLs actually indexed/linked externally.
# Cloudflare Pages _redirects syntax: <source> <destination> <status>
#
# Every .html source below has an extension-less twin too: the old site's
# Cloudflare Pages deployment served both (clean-URL resolution finding
# `page.html` for a request to `page`), so bookmarks/backlinks/search-engine
# indexing can use either form even though only .html was the sitemap's
# canonical one. Three would-be extension-less rules are omitted on purpose —
# /blog, /consulting, /products — because those bare paths are themselves the
# correct, real URLs on *this* site; redirecting them to themselves would
# break the actual pages living there.

# ── Sitemap ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Quarto published /sitemap.xml; @astrojs/sitemap publishes a sitemap INDEX
# (fanning out to sitemap-0.xml etc.) at a different path. Anything still
# pointed at the old URL — Search Console's stored submission included —
# would otherwise 404 instead of following through.
/sitemap.xml                                               /sitemap-index.xml                    301

